          "settings": {
            "eyebrow": "The beginning",
            "body": "<p>There's a road that climbs through the Hollywood Hills where the city starts to let go of you.</p><p>The noise softens. The buildings fall away. And somewhere between the last turn and the top, the world opens up in a way that makes you forget you were carrying anything at all.</p><p>What began as a sunset became a feeling. Los Angeles stretched out below, golden and endless, and for a moment nothing needed to be more than it already was.</p>",
