        "s05_idea": {
          "type": "narrative",
          "settings": {
            "eyebrow": "The idea",
            "body": "<p>Daphne Blue was born from a feeling. The feeling that beauty isn't something you chase. It's something you notice when you finally stand still.</p><p>A reminder that the world is full of extraordinary things if you let yourself see them. That the smallest details hold the most meaning. That slowing down isn't doing nothing, it's doing the thing that matters most.</p><p>We believe beauty lives in the in-between. In the imperfect. In the Tuesday morning light that catches something just right. In the parts of yourself you overlook because you're too busy performing for everyone else.</p>",
            "alignment": "centre",
            "padding": 120
          }
        },
        "s06_quote_beauty": {
          "type": "pull_quote",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "Beauty isn't something you chase. It's something you notice when you finally stand still.",
            "note": "",
